  "id": "exosystem",
  "term": "exosystem",
  "definition": "In Ecological Systems Theory, the exosystem is the organizational or community level of a person’s environment. It refers to surrounding conditions such as the household, neighborhood, time demands, child-related difficulties, and available social support that can influence family and parenting experiences.",
